{"availability":"available","full":"sandner-art/Audio-Shader-Studio","name":"Audio-Shader-Studio","description":" Audio reactive shader app for experiments. WebGL for high-performance shader rendering and the Web Audio API for real-time audio analysis.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":9,"forks":2,"created":"2025-09-12T20:24:10Z","updated":"2025-09-14T00:18:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sandner-art.github.io/Audio-Shader-Studio/","topics":["audio","audio-analysis","audio-visualizer","realtime-audio","shader-effects","shader-programming","shaders","spectral-analysis","webgl","webgl2"],"demo":"https://sandner-art.github.io/Audio-Shader-Studio/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.339Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.339Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.339Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.339Z","stars":9,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A real-time audio-reactive shader visualization platform for creative audio analysis and generative visual art. This application combines advanced digital signal processing with GPU-accelerated fragment shaders to create responsive visual experiences driven by audio features.","Audio Shader Studio implements real-time audio feature extraction and maps these features to GPU shader uniforms, enabling the creation of sophisticated audio-reactive visualizations. The platform supports multiple audio input sources, advanced spectral analysis, and provides a comprehensive set of audio-derived parameters for shader programming."],"features":["Real-time Audio Analysis: Extracts a rich set of audio features, from broad strokes like bass and treble to nuanced data like spectral centroid and beat detection.","Live GLSL Editor: Write and compile fragment shaders directly in the browser with instant visual feedback.","WebGL 1.0 & 2.0 Support: The app automatically detects and utilizes the best available WebGL version, supporting both GLSL ES 1.00 and 3.00.","Multi-Source Input: Load local audio files, use your microphone for live input, or engage with the built-in audio simulator.","Extensive Uniform Library: A comprehensive set of pre-calculated audio features are passed directly to your shaders, ready to use."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sandner-art/Audio-Shader-Studio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9bb07a3ecb9352453d0914ce3c0f2dd280a79bc32373db8bafe1b6c1a29499bb","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.413Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.413Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A real-time audio-reactive shader visualization platform for creative audio analysis and generative visual art. This application combines advanced digital signal processing with GPU-accelerated fragment shaders to create responsive visual experiences driven by audio features.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sandner-art/Audio-Shader-Studio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9bb07a3ecb9352453d0914ce3c0f2dd280a79bc32373db8bafe1b6c1a29499bb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sandner-art/Audio-Shader-Studio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.413Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-09-14T00:18:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sandner-art/Audio-Shader-Studio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.414Z","hash":"9bb07a3ecb9352453d0914ce3c0f2dd280a79bc32373db8bafe1b6c1a29499bb","originalBytes":10834,"storedBytes":10834,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["audio","shader","float","analysis","frequency","glsl","webgl","beat","features","uniform","fragment","spectral","detection","processing","spectrum","web","energy","input","mobile","mode","shaders","api","application","centroid","code","license","real-time","uniforms","browser","desktop","file","flux","fragcoord.xy","frame","guide","khronos","language","library","like","live","magnitude","micropho